{"id":"5c0fd5c6fd5532ff","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-beta-function.md","title":"A Constructive Arithmetic Beta Function","display":"df-smullyan-beta-function — A Constructive Arithmetic Beta Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-beta-function","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-beta-function"],"display":"df-smullyan-beta-function — A Constructive Arithmetic Beta Function","source":"第 IV 章 p. 47，Theorem B（PDF 64）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-beta-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-beta-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-beta-function — A Constructive Arithmetic Beta Function"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 p. 47，Theorem B（PDF 64）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e6768aadf6214a6\" href=\"?note=9e6768aadf6214a6\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code\">92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(w,i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_E\">\\(K_E\\)</span> 为有限数对成员关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_E:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\beta_E:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为下文定义的函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}beta\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\beta_E(w,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\min\\{a\\leq w:K_E(i,a,w)\\}&amp;\\exists a\\leq w\\;K_E(i,a,w),\\\\0&amp;\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\beta_E(w,i)=a&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n[K_E(i,a,w)\\land\\forall b&lt;a\\;\\neg K_E(i,b,w)]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\lor[a=0\\land\\neg\\exists b\\leq w\\;K_E(i,b,w)],\\\\\n\\{(w,i,a):\\beta_E(w,i)=a\\}&amp;\\in\\mathcal R_E^{0,3},\\qquad\\beta_E(w,i)\\leq w.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}beta\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\beta_E(w,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\min\\{a\\leq w:K_E(i,a,w)\\}&amp;\\exists a\\leq w\\;K_E(i,a,w),\\\\0&amp;\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\beta_E(w,i)=a&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n[K_E(i,a,w)\\land\\forall b&lt;a\\;\\neg K_E(i,b,w)]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\lor[a=0\\land\\neg\\exists b\\leq w\\;K_E(i,b,w)],\\\\\n\\{(w,i,a):\\beta_E(w,i)=a\\}&amp;\\in\\mathcal R_E^{0,3},\\qquad\\beta_E(w,i)\\leq w.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限非空候选集有唯一最小元素；为空时明确取 0，所以是全函数，不依赖选择或无界搜索。图的两个分支互斥且覆盖全部输入。输入 i&gt;w 时 K 的界条件使第二分支适用。</p>\n<p>函数图关系为原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0\">\\(\\Sigma_0\\)</span>；这是有有限初段编码能力的 β 函数，不是对每个无穷序列给一个自然数编码，也不是本地通用素数幂序列解码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code","status":"resolved","id":"9e6768aadf6214a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"w,i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"K_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_E:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}beta\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\beta_E(w,i)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\min\\{a\\leq w:K_E(i,a,w)\\}&\\exists a\\leq w\\;K_E(i,a,w),\\\\0&\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\beta_E(w,i)=a&\\leftrightarrow\n[K_E(i,a,w)\\land\\forall b<a\\;\\neg K_E(i,b,w)]\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}\\lor[a=0\\land\\neg\\exists b\\leq w\\;K_E(i,b,w)],\\\\\n\\{(w,i,a):\\beta_E(w,i)=a\\}&\\in\\mathcal R_E^{0,3},\\qquad\\beta_E(w,i)\\leq w.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0","display":false}],"bytes":1480,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-beta-function]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]] → [[92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"681d4278bd359695","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-beta-function]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-beta-function]]"}],"outgoing":["9e6768aadf6214a6"]}